OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday lets owner 'devastated' by
OL,4,Aphishing scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a small holiday let
OL,7,Fcompany said she was "devastated and
OL,8,Fexhausted" after thousands of fake
OL,9,Fproperty reservations were advertised
OL,10,Fin her company's name on Booking.com.
OL,12,FVictoria Pollard, who runs Exeter-based
OL,13,FLife's 2 Short, said some of those who
OL,14,Fmade the bookings had travelled from
OL,15,Foverseas and were left with nowhere to
OL,16,Fstay.
OL,18,FThe 46-year-old said the phishing
OL,19,Fattack left her with no access to her
OL,20,Faccounts in August causing genuine
OL,21,Freservations to be missed.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
